9.14.4 Precinct-specific planning controls

C1 Built form and subdivision proposals must:

i. Encourage re-instatement of original fencing materials and dimensions;   
ii. Retain existing outhouses within this precinct;   
iii. Retain original building alignments and setbacks;   
iv. Consider allowing additional density along rear lanes where the impact on the precinct will be minimal, through maintaining the original building and roof forms as visible from the public domain;   
